{"product_id":"iqos-terea-sun-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Sun Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet to know Terea Sun Pearl, where fruity and fresh meets sophisticated. Perfect for the modern palate, whether you’re at home or on the go. With its convenient packaging and compatibility with most devices, Terea Sun Pearl is more than just a product; it’s a lifestyle for flavor lovers in the Kenya.\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed \u003ca title=\"Terea cigarette\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\"\u003eterea cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41969798283319,"sku":"Terea Sun Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41969798316087,"sku":"Terea Sun Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-Sun-Pearl-indonesia-for-pods.webp?v=1762191553","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-sun-pearl","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




